---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import articles from "../data/articles";
import inventory from "../../data/inventory.json";
---

<Layout title="About & coverage">
  <div class="prose">
    <div class="eyebrow">BUILT WITH CARE</div>
    <h1>
      A useful wiki.
      <br />
      One guide at a time.
    </h1>
    <p class="lede">
      This independent DCUO reference currently contains {articles.length}{" "}
      reviewed starter guides. It is not a complete copy of the source wiki.
    </p>
    <h2>What makes the cut</h2>
    <p>
      We publish substantive guidance, not name-only entries or placeholders.
      Duplicate pages should be merged while preserving meaningful faction and
      version differences.
    </p>
    <h2>Quest standards</h2>
    <p>
      Quests need useful objectives or walkthroughs. We seek map locations and
      exact-quest YouTube references. Unverified coordinates and unrelated video
      matches are never presented as guidance. A useful guide may remain
      published with a clearly stated location limitation after research.
    </p>
    <h2>Sources and licensing</h2>
    <p>
      Starter text is adapted from DC Universe Online Wiki on Fandom, retrieved
      with Firecrawl. Each article links its original page and contributor
      history. Adapted text remains under the source's applicable{" "}
      <a href="https://www.fandom.com/licensing">CC-BY-SA terms</a>, except
      where the source indicates otherwise. Summaries, omissions, and layout
      changes are our adaptations. Images and trademarks may have different
      rights; this edition links map file pages instead of redistributing them.
    </p>
    <h2>Coverage limits</h2>
    <p>
      We have discovered{" "}
      {inventory.summary.articleCandidates.toLocaleString("en-US")} candidate
      article URLs so far. Only {articles.length} guides have been reviewed and
      published.{" "}
      {inventory.exhaustive
        ? "The source main-article index has been enumerated to its end."
        : "The candidate list is partial."}{" "}
      Candidates include possible aliases and unhelpful entries, and are not a
      count of finished guides. Supporting media and category indexes have not
      been fully enumerated.
    </p>
    <p>
      The initial map found 124 URLs, while the source homepage reported
      approximately 25,000 pages. That map is not an exhaustive inventory.
      Current work is a small extraction and publishing pilot. Gear values and
      rewards may be outdated; source review does not establish current in-game
      accuracy.
    </p>
    <h2>Contribute</h2>
    <p>
      Suggest a correction with a source or a precise location through{" "}
      <a href="https://github.com/ChrisTitusTech/dcuo-wiki/issues">
        the GitHub repository
      </a>
      .
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
